        </image>
      </figure>
    </sidebyside>

    <p>The red, left-hand column confirms a filter is in operation, and there are now 300 active rows.</p>

    <p>
      <ul>
        <li><p>Right-click in the option_a column and choose <alert><em>Levels/Labels</em></alert> again</p></li>
      </ul>
    </p>

    <p>The results show the Osun trial used 8 cassava varieties, and 37 or 38 farmers used each variety.</p>

    <p>Your data is improved, so:</p>

    <p>
      <ul>
        <li><p>Use the diskette icon on the toolbar, or <alert><em>File &gt; Save</em></alert>, Fig. 59 to save.</p></li>
      </ul>
    </p>

